From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: domicile CI <ci@domicile.invalid>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: a cast of a chosen desktop shows no picker

The engine casts the desktop to a TV with a desktop source it names
itself: the ScreenCast portal asks the shell what the TV shows. The
Media Router showed Chrome's screen picker for every desktop source,
and there is no browser window to show it over.

A desktop source that already names its desktop goes to its provider as
a picked one does. Only browser code makes one: a page's
PresentationRequest takes no desktop URL.

Verified: not built. This repository cannot build Chromium; the engine
job builds it on `crux`.
---
 .../media/router/mojo/media_router_desktop.cc        | 12 +++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/media/router/mojo/media_router_desktop.cc b/chrome/browser/media/router/mojo/media_router_desktop.cc
index 7180783..fa47b55 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/media/router/mojo/media_router_desktop.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/media/router/mojo/media_router_desktop.cc
@@ -206,7 +206,17 @@ void MediaRouterDesktop::CreateRoute(const MediaSource::Id& source_id,
                                     weak_factory_.GetWeakPtr(), presentation_id,
                                     provider_id, std::move(callback), false);
 
-  if (source.IsDesktopMirroringSource()) {
+  if (source.IsDesktopMirroringSource() && source.DesktopStreamId()) {
+    // DOMICILE: a desktop already chosen goes to its provider as a picked one
+    // does. The engine's casts name the desktop, whose picture the ScreenCast
+    // portal asks the shell for, and there is no browser window to show a
+    // picker over. Only browser code makes such a source: a page's
+    // PresentationRequest takes no desktop URL. See
+    // chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_cast_sinks.cc.
+    media_route_providers_[provider_id]->CreateRoute(
+        source_id, sink_id, presentation_id, origin, kDefaultFrameTreeNodeId,
+        timeout, std::move(mr_callback));
+  } else if (source.IsDesktopMirroringSource()) {
     desktop_picker_->Show(
         MakeDesktopPickerParams(web_contents),
         {DesktopMediaList::Type::kScreen},
